      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Reliable event trail",
      "items": [
        "Payment and compliance transitions write a transactional outbox.",
        "The relay publishes Kafka envelopes; idempotent ingestion persists the timeline for read APIs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Grounded compliance",
      "items": [
        "Policy indexing chunks documents, asks Ollama for embeddings, and publishes an immutable Oracle vector generation.",
